---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contacts, mailto } from '../config/site';
---

<Base
  title="Send feedback"
  description="Tell us what's working and what isn't in the Math Dragons beta."
  path="/feedback"
>
  <h1>Send feedback</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Thank you for testing Math Dragons. Honest feedback is the most useful thing you can give us,
    especially the parts your kid didn't like.
  </p>

  <div class="card highlight">
    <h2>Email us</h2>
    <p>
      <a class="button" href={mailto(contacts.support, 'Math Dragons beta feedback')}
        >Email {contacts.support}</a
      >
    </p>
    <p class="muted">We read everything and aim to respond within 48 hours.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What helps most</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Which games your kid went back to, and which they skipped</li>
    <li>Anything that was confusing, too hard or too easy</li>
    <li>Bugs: what happened, and your device model and system version</li>
    <li>Your kid's age (just the age, nothing else)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>On iPhone or iPad</h2>
  <p>
    You can also send feedback through TestFlight: take a screenshot while using Math Dragons, tap
    the screenshot preview, tap <strong>Done</strong>, then tap <strong>Share Beta Feedback</strong>. Or open the TestFlight app, choose Math Dragons, and
    tap <strong>Send Beta Feedback</strong>.
  </p>

  <p class="muted">
    Please send feedback as a parent or another adult. If you're under 13, ask a grown-up to write
    to us.
  </p>
</Base>
